flowchart LR
    Player[Player browser]
    Host[React / Next.js platform shell]
    Game[Phaser game module\nshared game contract]
    CDN[CDN and static asset delivery]
    API[Score and tournament API\nserver-side validation]
    Auth[Authentication]
    DB[(PostgreSQL\naccounts, attempts, bests, ranks)]
    Store[Replay and asset storage]
    Worker[Async verifier / moderation queue]
    Obs[Error, performance, and audit telemetry]

    Player --> Host
    Host --> Game
    Host --> CDN
    Host --> Auth
    Game -->|start attempt and submit result| API
    API --> DB
    API --> Store
    API --> Worker
    API --> Obs
    Worker --> DB
    DB -->|read-only leaderboard views| Host
